{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>據介紹，華為Pura X View通過軟硬芯雲垂直整合整機性能提升28%。同時，桌面操作流暢度提升41%、任務加載速度提升29%、任務切換速度提升15%。</p>\n<p>方舟引擎與HarmonyOS 7深度協同，對產品全鏈路性能進行系統性重構。值得一提的是，超空間內存技術讓12GB物理內存實現16GB級別的後台保活能力，多任務切換穩定性再進一步。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0907/d640992f1040770.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0907/8d303ba4e080d23.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0907/d640992f1040770.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T09:18:51.824252+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}